                <l xml:id="m-07e48b8b-0e71-435d-b9c8-e493edf5ec76" facs="#m-679d6bba-674c-4b2c-8443-34149aaf363b" label="ambiguous">s7e</l><l xml:id="m-3b9e3b62-ff31-46fe-a2c1-d37c2c8b7892" facs="#m-9081a5b3-b2bb-475b-845a-a9bf7b0da744" label="text-like">whit sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-d3bd8e06-8ddc-4bd3-b3a2-3242e39a955f" facs="#m-a6503521-37c5-4a22-9664-976b23333895" label="lyrics-like">mentis. Sed vidéte quid Véritas di-] sed tentatiónis témpore hoc ipsum,</l><l xml:id="m-3ee579f0-853e-48fb-998b-fd5ac222e4bd" facs="#m-906abf63-cae8-4781-9e9b-fcdf08173941" label="lyrics-like">quo compúncti fúerant, obliviscún¬</l><l xml:id="m-835c4a90-b0e8-4e39-bfa4-20282b628f29" facs="#m-9f659bc2-404e-49d2-a95f-31c2a5d508c6" label="lyrics-like">cat: Veniémus, et mansiónem apud</l><l xml:id="m-64b05b11-25b8-4541-80db-5d0e8973f746" facs="#m-113cf340-2412-44da-b2ce-e786b27beb58" label="lyrics-like">tur : sicque ad perpetránda peccáta</l><l xml:id="m-475d1e91-d754-409c-a8ed-deff0f839347" facs="#m-f1cd6a4e-73fc-42e9-8c53-a764372ad4b8" label="lyrics-like">eum faciémus. In quorúmdam éte¬</l><l xml:id="m-a42103f8-5f6b-4294-af40-72c391c19bd7" facs="#m-ff78982e-ecf5-4ed1-9a85-90ff2b314668" label="lyrics-like">rédeunt, ac si haec minime planxis¬</l><l xml:id="m-ad59380c-8ef0-4939-a46a-05e66df5c271" facs="#m-f0d67adc-5865-4a8b-b1a2-aaf93b43423e" label="lyrics-like">nim corda venit, et mansiónem non</l><l xml:id="m-90f35e2e-6280-4fcc-ac9d-2dbe90f31e16" facs="#m-9db993e7-d308-465f-a954-be219b2a87bd" label="ambiguous">sent.</l><l xml:id="m-b026a301-9a3e-426b-9b77-e8896db54674" facs="#m-4721032e-b476-4872-bec0-118d264e0ad8" label="lyrics-like">facit: quia, per compunctiónem</l><l xml:id="m-22f0a0d6-9ded-4051-8a9a-4ef3bfab52c9" facs="#m-b954483e-1d6d-4ca9-8ddf-fb158cf1bf3d" label="lyrics-like">Te Deum laudámus.</l><l xml:id="m-165d8926-edb3-42a9-b70e-5ae37b0e70c5" facs="#m-d9863a5c-2d7c-4065-b742-6009817809cf" label="lyrics-like">quidem, Dei respéctum percipiunt,</l><l xml:id="m-f1f1a41e-651b-4910-be26-d07fbb412c60" facs="#m-9e9c986e-67c1-4958-85f7-79eaa5c749f8" label="text-like">AT LAUDS.</l><l xml:id="m-e4dbb88f-7868-40fa-826c-93ef63cf76c6" facs="#m-800f4a6f-3143-4a21-8a98-ca2b98f28b4b" label="text-like">Antiphons of Vespers, p. 884. Psalms of Feasts, p. 221.</l><l xml:id="m-b97b646e-6d63-4f98-86e9-afa8181e4357" facs="#m-e7e18711-5d78-4aee-9cec-e3ed9fa6e809" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Cum compleréntur. p. 885.</l><l xml:id="m-9a84c176-4201-401b-b153-67a3e505c06e" facs="#m-07419a24-ff00-45f4-a8e4-794ea5e55c35" label="ambiguous">Hymn.E</l><l xml:id="m-63b6ea3c-4dbf-46a7-aebe-4904c3fadd38" facs="#m-d1eb10e2-722a-4b30-8417-371f0d49b87e" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-5620d403-108b-4429-b07b-825fb5d07163" facs="#m-b6622e7c-61eb-41e6-a522-72b47bf0701d" label="lyrics-like">E-á-ta nóbis gáudi-a</l><l xml:id="m-191ae18f-b33c-4ccb-873f-5fd26bdcffa5" facs="#m-0b05af6b-9b6e-453d-a5fd-02598bf31c6c" label="lyrics-like">Anni redú-xit órbi-ta,</l><l xml:id="m-07341d48-6cfe-4eca-bcfa-499e0eeae862" facs="#m-1763759b-646f-4486-838a-ed779cbc82c6" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spí-i-tus Pa-rácli-tus Illápsus est Apósto-lis. 2. Ignis</l><l xml:id="m-2d2a03f4-de2e-4eee-8a75-e70e1a4c36f2" facs="#m-c6c13d0d-40bb-42ca-a359-1640eb05450a" label="lyrics-like">vibránte lúmine</l><l xml:id="m-bd0b7e24-c3ab-497f-be28-a193794931ae" facs="#m-fac0fc4a-78cd-40ce-8541-77251c50e6a8" label="lyrics-like">Linguae figú-ram détu-lit, Vérbis ut</l><l xml:id="m-02973273-934a-4e4c-bb36-8e2c6bf59fe2" facs="#m-dbf97620-51f5-4069-9df2-85013d09f925" label="lyrics-like">éssent próflu-i,</l><l xml:id="m-4444c784-e962-47f2-ba1f-bf3c985c2afb" facs="#m-bd0372b5-fcec-46d2-8b6d-bd2c126d63ac" label="lyrics-like">Et cari-tá-te férvi-di. 3. Linguis loquún¬</l><l xml:id="m-9479730d-691b-47cf-96ca-20d8b1deae79" facs="#m-c447b112-ae16-4172-831d-5bc23c013b31" label="lyrics-like">tur ómni-um. Túrbae pávent Gentí-li- um: Músto madére</l><l xml:id="m-fe23f873-a36f-44fd-a51d-d511b9161c79" facs="#m-966f0fc0-7587-4859-b250-52791786b212" label="lyrics-like">députant Quos Spí-ri-tus repléve-rat. 4. Patrá-ta sunt haec</l><l xml:id="m-e8b21ff9-0e31-4e44-83ff-5e25dacbe129" facs="#m-d1a99700-a50a-44bd-ab18-6fb36f2b8d80" label="lyrics-like">mysti-ce, Páschae perácto témpo-re, Sácro di-érum círcu-lo,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>